Here, we are first checking if the clicked div is the first child of the parent in the DOM by using `$(this).index() === 0` condition. If it is, we are returning from the function without doing anything. If it is not the first div, we are using `siblings().eq(0)` method to select the first div element and get the distance between the clicked div and the first div.

