     velocity.y += gravity * deltaTime;
     pos.y += velocity.y * deltaTime;

     if(pos.y &lt; -2.0f) //a collision with the ground
     {
        velocity.y *= -1.0f * coefficientOfRestitution;
     }

}
</code></pre>

Note that you might need to adjust the value of the coefficient of restitution to get the desired behaviour. A value of 0.8 to 0.9 is usually a good starting point for most simulations.

