First, modify your custom deserializer to implement the <code>ContextualDeserializer</code> interface instead of <code>JsonDeserializer</code>:

<pre><code>public class MyCustomDepartmentDeserializer implements ContextualDeserializer&lt;Department&gt; {

    private DepartmentRepository departmentRepository;

