To exclude the `file` property from serialization, you can add the `@Exclude` annotation from the `JMS\Serializer\Annotation` namespace to the getter method in your entity:

<pre><code>use JMS\Serializer\Annotation\Exclude;

class Quotation implements FileStorageInterface
