    }
}</code></pre>

This way, the `file` property will be excluded from the serialized version of your entity. You will have to do this for all properties that should be excluded from serialization.

Alternatively, you can define a custom serialization handler that takes care of the serialization of entities that implement the `FileStorageInterface`. You can find more information about custom handlers in the JMS Serializer documentation.

